WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:03.002
-My next guest
is an award-winning actor

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:05.071
who stars in the new series
"Jupiter's Legacy,"

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:07.407
which premieres this Friday
on Netflix.

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:10.210
Please welcome Josh Duhamel!

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:14.747
Yeah! Oh, my goodness. Wow!

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:16.116
Oh, my goodness!

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:18.151
Thank you for coming back
to see us, buddy.

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:19.585
I appreciate this.

00:00:19.585 --> 00:00:22.222
I know you've been --
just finished filming a movie

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:24.557
with one of our favorites,
Jennifer Lopez.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:27.393
How is -- How's J. Lo doing?

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:29.362
And that's really
what I want to ask.

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:31.664
-[ Laughter ]
-She's fantastic.

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.867
I mean,
I've known her for years.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:37.003
And it just --
You know, it sort of came --

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:40.039
came to my attention
that the job became available,

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:43.009
and I got a chance
to, you know, meet with her.

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:45.645
And so it was like --
it was like, you know,

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:48.047
rekindling an old friendship
with an old friend.

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.449
But then we get to set.

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:52.084
You know, the Dominican is --
It's hot.

00:00:52.084 --> 00:00:53.986
Yeah.
-And beautiful.

00:00:53.986 --> 00:00:55.654
-Yeah.
So is -- so is J. Lo.

00:00:55.654 --> 00:00:58.324
-Yes, exactly.
-So is Josh Duhamel.

00:00:58.324 --> 00:00:59.859
Yeah, I mean --
-[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:02.896
-Hey, thank you.
Thank you, Jimmy.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.363
It was very hot.

00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:06.432
And we're sort of on the run
from these -- these pirates

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:08.868
and these people that
sort of overtook the wedding.

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:11.471
And so I'm like this -- this --

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:14.373
I just crawled out of a river
half the time in this movie.

00:01:14.373 --> 00:01:16.742
I'm completely soaked
and sweaty.

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:19.779
And she's just gorgeous
throughout the movie.

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:22.248
So I'm not sure
we're going to look like the --

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.350
the perfect couple half the time

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.585
because I'm, like, this
sweaty mess and she's, well --

00:01:26.585 --> 00:01:28.220
I mean, she's J. Lo, so...

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:30.556
-No. I'm sure it will work.
I'm sure it will work.

00:01:30.556 --> 00:01:32.992
You sent us a video,
and I got to say

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.460
it made me laugh so hard today.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:35.828
I was watching.

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:38.531
It's a beautiful video
of the Dominican Republic.

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:40.500
Do you want to explain what
happened before we see it?

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.134
Or how do we set it up?

00:01:42.134 --> 00:01:43.636
-So I had some time off.

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:46.739
And right below where we were --
where I was sort of staying,

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:50.309
near where my green room was,
was this beautiful little cove.

00:01:50.309 --> 00:01:53.846
And earlier in the shoot,
it was this

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:56.549
perfectly calm, turquoise little
cove that I could jump --

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:59.185
I actually jumped off
this platform into the water

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:01.654
and swam over to the beach
and walked back.

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.322
Well, about a week later,
this place

00:02:03.322 --> 00:02:05.558
was completely different
because it was now like --

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:07.760
The ocean was -- was
really tumultuous that day.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:11.330
And the waves were crashing
like 30 feet in the air.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:14.467
Well, this rogue wave comes up
as I'm videotaping this thing

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:18.370
and literally washed me almost
over the edge of this cliff.

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:20.974
And, you know, thankfully --
-I'm happy you're okay.

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:23.610
-Thankfully there's
this razor-sharp coral

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:25.612
that's there that held me up,
but it --

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:26.946
it turned me into hamburger

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:28.914
on many parts of my body
afterwards.

00:02:28.914 --> 00:02:31.950
But it was one of the near-death
experiences in my life for sure.

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:34.687
-I'm only laughing
because I know you're okay.

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:36.456
But --
-Yeah.

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:38.290
-You guys got to see this video.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.126
It is -- It's just --
I could see you --

00:02:40.126 --> 00:02:42.795
I could see you filming,
and it was just a disaster.

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:45.664
Watch this.

00:02:45.664 --> 00:02:47.066
Beautiful.

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:51.504
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:54.039
-Oh, my God. [ Laughs ]

00:02:54.039 --> 00:02:56.375
That's my favorite shot.

00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:58.611
[ Laughs ]

00:02:58.611 --> 00:03:00.513
-Oh, my God.
-Holy...

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:04.116
Oh, my God.
Dude, the shot of the sky.

00:03:04.116 --> 00:03:05.451
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:07.286
It's like -- Wow!
Don't mess with Mother Nature!

00:03:07.286 --> 00:03:08.487
You got rocked.

00:03:08.487 --> 00:03:10.289
-I cannot believe
my phone survived that.

00:03:10.289 --> 00:03:12.124
-Me neither.
-I can laugh about it now.

00:03:12.124 --> 00:03:13.426
And I never told anybody.

00:03:13.426 --> 00:03:15.194
You're the first person
I've shown that to because

00:03:15.194 --> 00:03:17.664
if I had shown that to Lionsgate
when we were shooting it,

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:19.231
They would've -- I don't know --

00:03:19.231 --> 00:03:20.900
They probably would have
kicked me off the movie.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:23.135
-Yeah, I'm happy
that you saved it for our show.

00:03:23.135 --> 00:03:25.170
That's what I --
I appreciate it.

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:27.206
I want to talk
about your Netflix series,

00:03:27.206 --> 00:03:28.608
"Jupiter's Legacy."

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:31.644
This is a big superhero series.
Can you set it up for us?

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:33.379
-Yeah. It's a -- It's a script

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:36.049
that I read about
a year and a half ago.

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:37.850
Lorenzo di Bonaventura
sent it to me.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:39.985
And I just loved the stor--
I loved more --

00:03:39.985 --> 00:03:43.723
as much the superhero aspect as
I did the family aspect of it.

00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:46.292
And it's really an examination
of the psychology

00:03:46.292 --> 00:03:48.628
behind what it would be like
to be these people.

00:03:48.628 --> 00:03:52.665
And there's an origins story
that starts in the late --

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:54.834
in the early '30s that goes --

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:57.636
And then we jump back and forth
to present time

00:03:57.636 --> 00:03:59.739
so you sort of see
how they became who they are

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:03.275
and then what the repercussions
of that are 90 years later.

00:04:03.275 --> 00:04:06.245
And -- And, you know, this guy

00:04:06.245 --> 00:04:08.214
can fly around the world
in 12 seconds

00:04:08.214 --> 00:04:10.349
and shoot laser beams
out of his eyeballs,

00:04:10.349 --> 00:04:12.417
but he can't communicate
with his 20-year-old daughter.

00:04:12.417 --> 00:04:14.487
And I found that
to be fascinating.

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:17.690
-Yeah. You do play --
You go all over the place.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:22.562
Here's you at the age
of 120 years old that you play.

00:04:22.562 --> 00:04:24.297
-Yeah. Obviously,
there's a muscle suit there.

00:04:24.297 --> 00:04:26.432
I don't know if you know this,
Jimmy, but I don't normally

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:28.534
look that muscular in real life.

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:30.203
-Uh, yeah,
I don't know if anyone's

00:04:30.203 --> 00:04:32.338
looking at your muscles
in this costume.

00:04:32.338 --> 00:04:34.107
[ Laughter ]

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:35.842
Maybe I'm wrong.

00:04:35.842 --> 00:04:37.243
[ Applause ]

00:04:37.243 --> 00:04:39.178
-But, you know, there's
the makeup and the prosthetics

00:04:39.178 --> 00:04:41.080
and the wig and the beard,
and then that muscle suit

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:43.249
and the cape and the suit
and all that stuff.

00:04:43.249 --> 00:04:46.719
You really feel like
you've been through it --

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:48.521
like you've been through
90 years of battles.

00:04:48.521 --> 00:04:49.956
And I'm very proud
of the series.

00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:51.457
I think people
are going to love it.

00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:53.593
-Yeah. I want to show everyone
a clip. It's great.

00:04:53.593 --> 00:04:56.095
Here's Josh Duhamel
in "Jupiter's Legacy."

00:04:56.095 --> 00:04:57.764
Take a look.

00:04:57.764 --> 00:05:00.032
-There's a million things
you could have done.

00:05:00.032 --> 00:05:02.235
You took the easy way out.

00:05:02.235 --> 00:05:03.903
-Did that look easy to you?!

00:05:03.903 --> 00:05:05.437
-Sheldon!

00:05:05.437 --> 00:05:08.640
-Go!
You wait for me at the union.

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:10.910
[ Whoosh ]

00:05:14.613 --> 00:05:15.948
Contact the Supermax.

00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:17.883
I want to know
how Blackstar got out.

00:05:17.883 --> 00:05:19.252
-On it.

00:05:19.252 --> 00:05:20.886
[ Whirring ]

00:05:20.886 --> 00:05:23.188
-You okay?

00:05:23.188 --> 00:05:24.991
-No.

00:05:26.458 --> 00:05:29.661
-Our son took a life.

00:05:29.661 --> 00:05:33.299
After everything we've
taught him, he broke the code.

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:36.001
-[ Cheers and applause ]
-Josh Duhamel!

00:05:36.001 --> 00:05:39.238
"Jupiter's Legacy" premieres
this Friday on Netflix.

